---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout title="找不到頁面｜紅河隱園">
  <main class="page-main" id="main-content" tabindex="-1">
    <section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="not-found-heading">
      <div class="content-inner">
        <h1 class="section-heading" id="not-found-heading">找不到頁面</h1>
        <p>您要找的頁面不存在，或已經移動。</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/">回首頁</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>
